    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_receptionist_00",
      "hash64": "DF57B8C8336F5CE1",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Willkommen in der Montanata-Arena,\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BD06",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "DF57B7C8336F5B2E",
      "text": "Möchtest du Arenaleiter Grusha herausfordern,\\nden Snowboarder mit den coolsten Tricks?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "DF57B6C8336F597B",
      "text": "Dann bringe ich dich jetzt zum Kampfplatz!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "DF57B5C8336F57C8",
      "text": "Sag einfach Bescheid, sobald du bereit bist!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_poke_01",
      "hash64": "A9AAA4A6391CB134",
      "text": "Waaaaal!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_00",
      "hash64": "4FB91B84C5B57C58",
      "text": "Da hast du also gesteckt.[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_01",
      "hash64": "4FB91C84C5B57E0B",
      "text": "Brrr... Mir ist kalt...[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_02",
      "hash64": "4FB91D84C5B57FBE",
      "text": "Oh... [VAR 0x1100(00FF,1312,0000)]Ein HerausfordererEine Herausforderin?[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "1312",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_03",
      "hash64": "4FB91E84C5B58171",
      "text": "Ich heiße Grusha.\\c\\nFrüher war ich Profi-Snowboarder, aber jetzt bin\\nich hier der Arenaleiter.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_04",
      "hash64": "4FB91F84C5B58324",
      "text": "Nicht schlecht, wie du die Piste runtergerutscht\\nbist.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_05",
      "hash64": "4FB92084C5B584D7",
      "text": "Aber lass dir das ja nicht zu Kopf steigen.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_06",
      "hash64": "4FB92184C5B5868A",
      "text": "So ein eisiger Berg ist gefährlich. Er kann dein\\nLeben im Handumdrehen aus der Bahn werfen.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_07",
      "hash64": "4FB92284C5B5883D",
      "text": "Dasselbe gilt für Pokémon-Kämpfe.\\c\\nAm gefährlichsten wird es, wenn man glaubt,\\nalles unter Kontrolle zu haben.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 112,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_08",
      "hash64": "4FB91384C5B56EC0",
      "text": "Du hast dir nicht gerade den besten Tag\\nausgesucht, um gegen mich anzutreten...[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_09",
      "hash64": "4FB91484C5B57073",
      "text": "Bestehst du wirklich auf einen Kampf?[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_select_01",
      "hash64": "51F3FDED0BC782C7",
      "text": "Ja.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_select_02",
      "hash64": "51F3FEED0BC7847A",
      "text": "Nein, warte...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_10",
      "hash64": "4FBCA184C5B895E1",
      "text": "Keine kalten Füße bekommen? Schade.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_11",
      "hash64": "4FBCA084C5B8942E",
      "text": "Es erfordert Mut innezuhalten. Aber Leute wie\\ndu entscheiden sich letztendlich immer dafür,\\r\\nunaufhaltsam voranzuschreiten.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 125,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_12",
      "hash64": "4FBC9F84C5B8927B",
      "text": "Na ja, was auch immer gleich geschieht, mach dir\\nnichts draus. Das ist schließlich mein Job.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_13",
      "hash64": "4FBC9E84C5B890C8",
      "text": "Ich werde dir zeigen, dass die Realität ebenso\\nkalt und gnadenlos ist wie der Schnee.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_14",
      "hash64": "4FBCA584C5B89CAD",
      "text": "Trotz aller Widrigkeiten beweist du den Eifer,\\ndie Zukunft selbst in die Hand zu nehmen.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_15",
      "hash64": "4FBCA484C5B89AFA",
      "text": "In deinem Alter war ich ganz genauso...[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_16",
      "hash64": "4FBCA384C5B89947",
      "text": "Ach, was rede ich da... Ich muss dir noch deinen\\nOrden überreichen.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_17",
      "hash64": "4FBCA284C5B89794",
      "text": "Wie bitte? Du möchtest als Erinnerung an deinen\\nSieg ein Foto mit mir?[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_18",
      "hash64": "4FBC9984C5B88849",
      "text": "Hmpf... Also normalerweise kann ich mit so was\\nja nichts anfangen...\\c\\nAber na gut, als Ausnahme für dich.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 107,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_badge",
      "hash64": "5219C9B7E108FDE3",
      "text": "Wenn du [VAR 0x0200(0001)] Arenaorden besitzt, lassen sich\\nPokémon bis Level [VAR 0x0201(0002)] leichter fangen und\\r\\ngehorchen dir ohne Probleme.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0200",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0201",
          "args_hex": [
            "0002"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 119,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_badge_all",
      "hash64": "63225360EE7BC80F",
      "text": "Wenn du acht Arenaorden hast, kannst du alle\\nPokémon fangen und sie hören auf jeden\\r\\ndeiner Befehle.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 102,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_waza",
      "hash64": "1932E75136CD36D1",
      "text": "Oh, und bevor ich es vergesse... Hier ist noch was\\nfür dich.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_19",
      "hash64": "4FBC9884C5B88696",
      "text": "Das ist auf jeden Fall nützlicher als so ein Foto\\nmit mir...[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_20",
      "hash64": "4FC02784C5BBAF6A",
      "text": "Wenn dir die Kälte hier nichts ausmacht, kannst\\ndu gerne mal wiederkommen... Man sieht sich.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_receptionist_04",
      "hash64": "DF57BCC8336F63AD",
      "text": "Glückwunsch zu deinem Sieg in der\\nMontanata-Arena!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
  ]
}
